\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36463958, "text": "You could also use this activity to think about numbers:\n<ul>\n<li>Can you put different numbers of objects into each container?</li>\n<li>How many objects are in each container?</li>\n<li>Which container has most things in it? Which has fewest?</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 36463565, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36463958, "text": "You could also use this activity to think about numbers:\n<ul>\n<li>Can you put different numbers of objects into each container?</li>\n<li>How many objects are in each container?</li>\n<li>Which container has most things in it? Which has fewest?</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 36463565, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36463878, "text": "Here are some questions you could ask:\n<ul >\n<li>Which objects were easy to pick up?</li> \n<li>Which objects were more challenging to pick up?</li>\n<li>Can you use your peg to sort the objects into the different containers?</li>\n<li>How many different ways can you sort them?</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1633949226428_1image1-01FHQF8AF431AGCPK8C4XEFFMD.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 36463565, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36463878, "text": "Here are some questions you could ask:\n<ul >\n<li>Which objects were easy to pick up?</li> \n<li>Which objects were more challenging to pick up?</li>\n<li>Can you use your peg to sort the objects into the different containers?</li>\n<li>How many different ways can you sort them?</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1633949226428_1image1-01FHQF8AF431AGCPK8C4XEFFMD.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData"